{"seq":2,"slug":"fsm-vs-statecharts","title":"状态机与状态图：从五元组到 Harel 形式主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-machines-statecharts/foundations/fsm-vs-statecharts","wordCount":1585,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态机与状态图-从五元组到-harel-形式主义\">状态机与状态图：从五元组到 Harel 形式主义</h1><p>「状态机」这个词在前端语境里常被含糊使用，但它其实指向两个精确程度不同的东西：经典的有限状态机（finite state machine，FSM）和 David Harel 1987 年提出的状态图（statecharts）。前者是计算理论里定义严密的数学对象，后者是为了让 FSM 能扛住真实复杂系统而做的可视化扩展。搞清这两者的确切关系，才能明白 XState 里那些层级、并行的写法到底在实现什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-有限状态机的五元组定义\">核心概念：有限状态机的五元组定义</h2><p>一台确定性有限状态机在形式上是一个五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = (Q, \\Sigma, \\delta, q_0, F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是有限的状态集合；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是有限的输入字母表，在前端语境里就是事件集合；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta: Q \\times \\Sigma \\to Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是转移函数，它接收「当前状态」和「一个事件」，返回「下一个状态」；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0 \\in Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是初始状态；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F \\subseteq Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是接受（终止）状态集合。转移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是整台机器的灵魂——它是一个纯函数，给定相同的状态与事件必然得到相同的下一状态，这个纯粹性正是状态机可测、可预测、可可视化的根源。</p>\n<p>下面这张图是一台最小 FSM：一个交通灯，状态集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>红</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>绿</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>黄</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = \\{红, 绿, 黄\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">红</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">绿</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">黄</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，事件集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma = \\{TIMER\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，转移函数把每个状态在 <code>TIMER</code> 事件下映射到下一个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    red[红灯] --&gt;|TIMER| green[绿灯]&#10;    green[绿灯] --&gt;|TIMER| yellow[黄灯]&#10;    yellow[黄灯] --&gt;|TIMER| red[红灯]\">graph TD\n    red[红灯] --&gt;|TIMER| green[绿灯]\n    green[绿灯] --&gt;|TIMER| yellow[黄灯]\n    yellow[黄灯] --&gt;|TIMER| red[红灯]</pre><p>这台机器完美体现了 FSM 的约束力：处于红灯时，除了 <code>TIMER</code> 没有任何事件能改变它；<code>δ(红, TIMER) = 绿</code> 是唯一出路。不存在「红灯直接跳黄灯」的转移，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 里没有这条映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fsm-在哪里力不从心-状态爆炸\">FSM 在哪里力不从心：状态爆炸</h2><p>FSM 优雅，但朴素地用它建模真实系统会遭遇「状态爆炸」。设想一个媒体播放器，主流程有 <code>停止/播放/暂停</code> 三态；现在加一个正交的维度——是否静音，两态；再加一个——是否全屏，两态。如果坚持用纯 FSM，你必须把这些维度做笛卡尔积：<code>播放-静音-全屏</code>、<code>播放-静音-窗口</code>、<code>播放-有声-全屏</code>……三个维度就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 2 \\times 2 = 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 个状态，每加一个正交开关状态数翻倍，转移边呈组合式膨胀。这与<a href=\"why-state-machines\">为何状态机</a>里批判的标志位爆炸看似矛盾，实则是同一枚硬币的两面：标志位把状态空间隐式膨胀，朴素 FSM 把它显式膨胀，都无法优雅表达「多个正交子系统同时存在」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态图-harel-加的三样东西\">状态图：Harel 加的三样东西</h2><p>Harel 的洞见是给 FSM 加三种正交扩展，把状态爆炸摁下去。第一是<strong>层级（hierarchy）</strong>：状态可以嵌套，一个「复合状态」内部包含一整台子状态机，父状态上的转移被所有子状态继承，于是「无论在播放还是暂停，按停止键都回到停止」只需在父层画一条边。第二是<strong>并行（orthogonality）</strong>：一个状态可以同时处于多个正交区域，静音维度和全屏维度各自是一个独立区域，同时活跃却互不干扰，把笛卡尔积从状态数变成区域数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 个状态回落成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 + 2 + 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>。第三是<strong>历史（history）</strong>：复合状态能记住上次离开时内部停在哪个子状态，下次进入时恢复，这让「暂停后恢复播放到原来的位置」成为一等公民。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>朴素 FSM</th>\n<th>Harel 状态图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一活动状态</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>复合/并行下可多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层级嵌套</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有，父转移被子继承</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正交并行区域</td>\n<td>无（需笛卡尔积）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史状态</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（浅/深历史）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守卫条件</td>\n<td>无（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是纯映射）</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进入/离开动作</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态数增长</td>\n<td>随维度指数</td>\n<td>随维度线性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三样扩展的精确语义——复合状态怎么解析初始子态、并行区域如何同步、历史如何区分浅深——是<a href=\"../statecharts/hierarchical-parallel\">层级与并行状态</a>的主题，本篇只交代它们「为何存在」。守卫与动作同理，细节在<a href=\"../statecharts/guards-actions\">守卫与动作</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态图不是可选糖-是不同的表达力\">状态图不是可选糖，是不同的表达力</h2><p>一个常见误解是把层级、并行当成「可有可无的语法糖」。从计算理论看它们确实不增加可计算性——任何状态图都能展开成一台等价的朴素 FSM。但从工程表达力看，这个展开是灾难性的：一张有三个并行区域、每区域五个状态的状态图，展开后是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5^3 = 125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125</span></span></span></span></span> 个扁平状态，人类无法维护。状态图的价值恰恰在于让你<strong>以人能理解的结构</strong>书写那台等价的巨型 FSM。这与高级语言相对汇编的关系一样——不增加图灵机能算什么，却决定了人能不能写出来。</p>\n<p>W3C 后来把 Harel 状态图的语义标准化为 SCXML（State Chart XML），XState 的转移解析、并行同步等行为大体遵循这套标准语义，因此理解本篇的概念框架，你读任何一个正经的状态图实现都不会迷路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>有限状态机是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = (Q, \\Sigma, \\delta, q_0, F)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，核心是纯转移函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta: Q \\times \\Sigma \\to Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，其纯粹性是可测可视化的根源。</li>\n<li>朴素 FSM 遇到多个正交维度会状态爆炸，状态数随维度指数增长，无法优雅建模真实系统。</li>\n<li>Harel 状态图加了层级、并行、历史三种正交扩展，把状态数增长从指数压回线性；还引入守卫与进入/离开动作。</li>\n<li>这些扩展不增加可计算性（都能展开成等价 FSM），但极大提升人类可书写的表达力——类比高级语言之于汇编。</li>\n<li>W3C SCXML 标准化了状态图语义，XState 大体遵循，理解本篇概念可迁移到任何正经实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"why-state-machines\">为何状态机</a>——本篇假设你已认同「显式状态优于标志位」。</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../statecharts/hierarchical-parallel\">层级与并行状态</a>——本篇提到的三样扩展的精确语义。</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../statecharts/guards-actions\">守卫与动作</a>——状态图相对 FSM 的另两项扩展。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../state-management-patterns/fundamentals/reactivity-models\">响应式模型</a>——状态机之外的另一类状态原语，可对照理解。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/signal-core-concept\">信号的核心概念</a>——信号是另一种状态抽象层，与状态机是不同维度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态机与状态图：从五元组到 Harel 形式主义","id":"状态机与状态图-从五元组到-harel-形式主义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：有限状态机的五元组定义","id":"核心概念-有限状态机的五元组定义"},{"level":2,"text":"FSM 在哪里力不从心：状态爆炸","id":"fsm-在哪里力不从心-状态爆炸"},{"level":2,"text":"状态图：Harel 加的三样东西","id":"状态图-harel-加的三样东西"},{"level":2,"text":"状态图不是可选糖，是不同的表达力","id":"状态图不是可选糖-是不同的表达力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何状态机：从标志位地狱到显式状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-machines-statecharts/foundations/why-state-machines"},"next":{"title":"把 UI 建模为状态：从交互到状态图的手艺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-state-machines-statecharts/foundations/ui-as-states"}}